WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:13.403
Vinnie was tired from unloading so many flowers.

2
00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:19.507
As he rested in the empty wagon, he saw a side door of the palace open.

3
00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:23.638
A bearded man in dark clothes stepped out.

4
00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:26.535
He was speaking with another man.

5
00:00:26.536 --> 00:00:30.646
Vinnie sank down in the wagon, hiding.

6
00:00:30.647 --> 00:00:36.854
"Rasputin, the Russian people are angry," said the bearded man's companion.

7
00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:40.298
"They want the czar to pay attention to them!"

8
00:00:40.299 --> 00:00:43.014
"I agree," said Rasputin.

9
00:00:43.015 --> 00:00:45.713
"But what can I do?"

10
00:00:45.714 --> 00:00:50.978
"The people are desperate," the other man said sadly.

11
00:00:50.979 --> 00:00:55.779
"I'm afraid they will rise up and hurt the royal family."

12
00:00:55.780 --> 00:01:00.782
The men walked away, and Vinnie got out of the wagon.

13
00:01:00.783 --> 00:01:02.487
"Who is Rasputin?"

14
00:01:02.488 --> 00:01:06.633
Vinnie wondered, heading back into the palace.

15
00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:12.338
Inside, Anastasia was telling Mandy about her older sisters.

16
00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:15.783
"They're so annoying, really.

17
00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:19.710
All they care about is their powder and lipstick.

18
00:01:19.711 --> 00:01:23.895
I think they look like clowns," she said.

19
00:01:23.896 --> 00:01:26.568
"Do you have any sisters?"

20
00:01:26.569 --> 00:01:30.972
"No, only a brother," Mandy replied.

21
00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:33.950
Suddenly, she missed Vinnie.

22
00:01:33.951 --> 00:01:39.575
"I have a brother too. Alexei," Anastasia's voice softened.

23
00:01:39.576 --> 00:01:41.337
"He's a joy.

24
00:01:41.338 --> 00:01:44.127
Have you seen our piano room?"

25
00:01:44.128 --> 00:01:47.362
"No, but Miss Pavlova . . . ,"

26
00:01:47.363 --> 00:01:50.758
Mandy began, holding the ruffle.

27
00:01:50.759 --> 00:01:55.771
Anastasia took the ruffle and stopped a servant passing by.

28
00:01:55.772 --> 00:01:58.777
"Take this to Miss Pavlova.

29
00:01:58.778 --> 00:02:03.163
Tell her I needed Mandy's assistance," she said.

30
00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:07.135
Anastasia linked her arm through Mandy's.

31
00:02:07.136 --> 00:02:10.406
"Now, for the piano room!"

32
00:02:10.407 --> 00:02:17.279
Meanwhile, Vinnie had found Mikhail in the kitchen drinking a glass of water.

33
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.787
"What are these flowers for again?" asked Vinnie.

34
00:02:21.788 --> 00:02:26.311
"Today the royal family will receive another Fabergé egg.

35
00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:30.593
They get one every Easter," explained Mikhail.

36
00:02:30.594 --> 00:02:35.037
"The czar has a big feast to celebrate the new egg."

37
00:02:35.038 --> 00:02:40.340
"What's so great about an egg?" asked Vinnie.

38
00:02:40.341 --> 00:02:46.188
"This is not an ordinary egg," laughed Mikhail.

39
00:02:46.189 --> 00:02:49.469
"It is a work of art made of jewels and gold.

40
00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:52.149
You have to see it to believe it."

41
00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:58.754
At that moment, Anastasia was showing Mandy a cabinet filled with Fabergé eggs.

42
00:02:58.755 --> 00:03:03.437
Each egg was decorated according to a different theme.

43
00:03:03.438 --> 00:03:05.638
"This egg was special,"

44
00:03:05.639 --> 00:03:12.250
Anastasia said, pointing to a gold egg with a miniature golden carriage beside it.

45
00:03:12.251 --> 00:03:16.916
"My father gave this to my mother in 1897.

46
00:03:16.917 --> 00:03:21.148
That was the year he became the czar of Russia."

47
00:03:21.149 --> 00:03:24.122
Mandy was fascinated.

48
00:03:24.123 --> 00:03:27.067
She looked at some other eggs.

49
00:03:27.068 --> 00:03:32.633
One had a crown on top that was covered in rubies and diamonds.

50
00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:37.208
"Turn the pearl button on the side," ordered Anastasia.

51
00:03:37.209 --> 00:03:39.370
Mandy obeyed.

52
00:03:39.371 --> 00:03:44.606
The crown rose and three small picture frames popped out.

53
00:03:44.607 --> 00:03:51.849
"Here's Papa, and Olga and Tatiana, my two eldest sisters," explained Anastasia.

54
00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:57.712
"So each egg has a surprise in it," remarked Mandy.

55
00:03:57.713 --> 00:04:00.375
Anastasia nodded.

56
00:04:00.376 --> 00:04:03.626
"We are getting a new egg today!"

57
00:04:03.627 --> 00:04:08.881
Suddenly, Mandy remembered the egg-shaped object in the photo.

58
00:04:08.882 --> 00:04:17.586
"I must be in the right place," she thought.
